  reading:{
    title:"Reading in the Digital Age", est:"khoảng 340 từ · 13 phút",
    paras:[
      "A hundred years ago, being able to read was a skill that many adults did not have. In 1900, it is estimated that only around one in five people in the world could read and write. Today the figure is more than eight in ten, which is one of the greatest achievements in human history.",
      "However, the way we read is changing. Most young people now read more words on screens than on paper. Some researchers worry that screen reading encourages ‘skimming’: moving quickly over a text to find key facts without reading every sentence carefully.",
      "In one experiment, two groups of students read the same short story, one group on paper and the other on a tablet. When they were tested afterwards, both groups remembered the main characters equally well. However, the paper readers were much better at putting the events of the story in the correct order.",
      "Not everyone agrees that screens are bad for reading. Supporters point out that ebooks allow readers to change the size of the text, which helps people with poor eyesight, and that online dictionaries make it easy to check new words. For language learners in particular, these tools can be essential.",
      "So what should readers do? Experts suggest a simple rule: use screens for short, practical texts such as news and emails, but choose paper for long or difficult texts that need deep concentration. Turning off notifications can also help readers to concentrate when they do use a screen."
    ],
    quiz:[
      {t:"head",text:"Câu 1–5: Đoạn nào (A–E) chứa thông tin sau?"},
      {q:"the results of a study comparing two ways of reading",o:["A","B","C","D","E"],a:2},
      {q:"advice about when to choose paper or a screen",o:["A","B","C","D","E"],a:4},
      {q:"a figure about reading ability in the past",o:["A","B","C","D","E"],a:0},
      {q:"some advantages of reading on a screen",o:["A","B","C","D","E"],a:3},
      {q:"a concern about a reading habit",o:["A","B","C","D","E"],a:1},
      {t:"head",text:"Câu 6–8: Hoàn thành bảng. Điền MỘT TỪ trong bài."},
      {t:"gap",q:"Experiment · both groups remembered the characters ___ well",a:["equally"]},
      {t:"gap",q:"Experiment · paper readers were better at putting events in the correct ___",a:["order"]},
      {t:"gap",q:"Ebooks · readers can change the ___ of the text",a:["size"]}
    ]
  },
